<decision #track.add-eidolon-workflow-runtime-run-tools.runtime-owner {
  status = "accepted"
  priority = "P0"
}
(
  <question ?>Workflow runtime tools 是否创建独立 workflow run store？</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>不创建。</?>
    <decision-text ?>首版 workflow run/status/events/result/resume 复用 detached actor registry 与 observability facts。</?>
    <rationale ?>Mission 决策要求 workflow 自己只保存 workflow facts，runtime facts 由 Eidolon actor/session/runtime-control 体系拥有。</?>
    <evidence ?>mission decisions；design.md。</?>
  )>
)>
